        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"What the Water Gave Me\" song, \"Ceremonials\", \"What the Water Gave Me\" painting\n- People: Florence Welch, Francis \"Eg\" White, Paul Epworth, Frida Kahlo\n- Companies: Florence and the Machine\n\nFacts:\n- Frida Kahlo completed the oil painting \"What the Water Gave Me\" (\"Lo que el agua me dio\" in Spanish) in 1938.\n- Florence and the Machine released the song \"What the Water Gave Me\" on their 2011 second studio album \"Ceremonials\".\n- Florence Welch and Francis \"Eg\" White wrote the song \"What the Water Gave Me\".\n- Paul Epworth produced the song \"What the Water Gave Me\".",
